% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


small undertakings is identified by "http://example.org/SmallUndertakings".

small undertakings is an agent type.

small undertakings is defined by def small undertakings.

small undertakings has the comment "This agent type is defined by the criteria in the Small Undertakings definition.".


def small undertakings is identified by "http://example.org/Def_SmallUndertakings".

def small undertakings is a definition.

def small undertakings has the definiendum "small undertakings".

def small undertakings has the definiens "undertakings which meet 2 of 3 following criterias: ...".


temporal data breach is identified by "http://example.org/TemporalDataBreach".

temporal data breach is a temporal specification.

temporal data breach is defined by def personal data breach.

temporal data breach has the comment "This temporal event is defined by the GDPR personal data breach definition.".


def personal data breach is identified by "http://example.org/Def_PersonalDataBreach".

def personal data breach is a definition.

def personal data breach has the definiendum "personal data breach".

def personal data breach has the definiens "a breach of security leading to the accidental or unlawful destruction, loss, alteration, unauthorised disclosure of, or access to, personal data transmitted, stored or otherwise processed".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query definitions is:
    which thing is a definition.

query definienda is:
    which definition has the definiendum which text.

query definientia is:
    which definition has the definiens which text.

query agent_types is:
    which thing is an agent type.

query first_dates is:
    the first date of which temporal specification is which date.

query last_dates is:
    the last date of which temporal specification is which date.

query later_times is:
    which temporal specification is later than which second temporal specification.

query times_within is:
    which temporal specification is during which second temporal specification.

query broken_links is:
    which temporal specification breaks its link with which second temporal specification.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

